==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[fimmtíu]]'' meaning "[[fifty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[einn]]'' "[[one]]". Meaning '''fifty and one'''.

===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral|g=m}}

# '''[[fifty-one]]'''; the cardinal number after [[fimmtíu#Icelandic|fimmtíu]] and before [[fimmtíu og tveir#Icelandic|fimmtíu og tveir]].

